What to do after logging in to the game for the first time
Type /help. This will open a menu in which various categories can be found, containing useful information on different topics of the game.
Enable auto walking. This will make you walk continuously in a direction.
Use f5 and f6, as well as shift f5 and f6 to adjust the music and src volume.
Read the readme.txt, familiarize yourself with the game controls.
Open the grand opening pack from your inventory. This will give you the necessary items to start playing the game.
Use health boxes and health healers to heal your health whenever it is low
Note, don't use the field card as long as you do not wish to fight! As soon as you use it you will be moved to the battlefield.
Start exploring the game. Go to evermore city.
Visit the mall to buy different items, such as weapons, healing items, explosives, etcetera.
Travel to the jungle to start hunting.
Kill various animals, earning items and money, as well as increasing levels.
Explore different challenges, as they are one of the ways by which you can obtain a substantial supply of items.
When you feel like you have gained a good command on fighting animals and people, as well as crossing different challenges, enter the story mode.